294
00:24:43,248 --> 00:24:46,081
She has more experience with this kind of hellish nightmare

295
00:24:46,284 --> 00:24:48,218
than anyone else here .

296
00:24:48,453 --> 00:24:50,318
Hey , Raccoon City , isn 't that where the ... ?

297
