452
00:37:46,564 --> 00:37:49,727
- You think they 're after the data too ? - Could it be ?

453
00:37:49,934 --> 00:37:53,131
Why don 't you tell us what their demands are already ?

454
00:37:54,705 --> 00:37:58,266
If you don 't wanna talk I 'll just go directly to the president .

455
00:37:58,476 --> 00:38:00,467
The truth .

456
00:38:01,145 --> 00:38:02,407
Truth ?

457
00:38:02,613 --> 00:38:04,046
