488
00:40:57,254 --> 00:40:59,882
I 'm going to the office and check on the development data .

489
00:41:00,090 --> 00:41:04,789
Can I help you with something ? Don 't worry . I 'm not scheming

490
00:41:04,995 --> 00:41:08,726
